<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Hibruw</para>
  <para style="toc1">Neletes Hiy Ige Hibruw</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hibruw</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hib</para>
  <para style="rem">Second draft with Tom and Norris 2021</para>
  <para style="rem">reading through with Colenso 2022</para>
  <para style="mt">Neletes Hiy Ige Hibruw</para>
  <para style="imt">?Neletes gōh nikaka gatay nahap?</para>
  <para style="ip">Neletes gōh van hiy ige Juw mey a kēy nēdēmtig Tigsas. Neletes gōh nim̄ōleg qeleave Tigsas nileh namtehal bomogmogo goy Ḡod Layapyap Tēnēte mi namtehal gayaq. Kē nigaleg so ige Juw tey maymay nēdēmtig nonoy.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gēn et ēglal te so ihē mayap neletes gōh. Kē et hohole te qele Pol, ba kē mavasem so kē mēglal yaplōplōn Pol yatkelgi. Kē mayap neletes tege qeleso lēte 68 AD.</para>
  <para style="ip">Neletes gōh mayap vasem woqse hap susu lēvēnan ige Juw. Nahaphap nan mey ige Juw nēglal galsi aē en, kē nim̄ōleg nahaphap gayaq aē veg Tigsas.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kē nim̄ōleg so Tigsas en, kē neketket yeh den ige in̄sel, wa neketket yeh den Nele non Mosis. Tō Tigsas neketket yeh den Mosis, tō neketket yeh den napnō mey a Ḡod melep van hiy ige Juw. Tō Tigsas ikē nitiy pris liwo, mey a itōk veteg den nipris liwo non ige Juw. Veg nolol mey Tigsas magaleg en, kē itōk veteg nolol non ige Juw tam̄ag. Veg nahap mey a Tigsas nigaleg en titig lap vaga, et qele te namgumgu non ige Juw tam̄ag. Bah tō, kē nivahiy maymay ige Juw so tig maymay lēdēmtig nonoy lahan Tigsas.</para>
  <para style="ip">Neletes gōh nihole gatay nakavanan tam̄ag wa nakavanan gayaq. ?Ba nakavanan vitwag nahap? Nakavanan qeleso napnopnog mey net vōyō ak maymay mi navatvat. Net vōyō niqetqet nahap qiyig vitwag. Tō kōyō vatvat vivitwag so dam tatag napnopnog nan, tō kōyō vēhge Ḡod so nivēvēg net mey a nihigap den. Nelegleg en, kē nakavanan vitwag. Nakavanan nivasemlō galsi so net vivitwag so nigaleg nahap, wa nēvēvēg nan nahap. Lōqōn̄ non Mosis, ige a nēqēt mayanag en, kēy mak nakavanan so nimyin̄ kēy qele gēn togtōkē mayap constitution. Lakavanan tam̄ag en, ige Juw mavatvat so dam Nele non Mosis, tō Ḡod mavatvat so etgoy kēy mahē kēy dam galsi. Tō kēy mōliwo Ḡod mi nolol tegtegha. Lakavanan gayaq en, Tigsas mavatvat so nivaēh ige mey nēdēmtig kē.</para>
  <para style="is">Nakaka geh van alon en</para>
  <para style="ip">1:1-4 Ḡod mohole me hiy ige Juw heylō Ēntēn</para>
  <para style="ip">1:5-14 Tigsas itōk veteg ige in̄sel</para>
  <para style="ip">2:1-4 Ḡod tēvēvēg ige mey a et yon̄teg te Welan</para>
  <para style="ip">2:5-9 Ḡod metyak Tigsas so nimyanag goy namyam</para>
  <para style="ip">2:10-18 Tigsas mēvēhgi et tō so nimyin̄ gēn</para>
  <para style="ip">3:1-19 Tigsas neketket den Mosis</para>
  <para style="ip">4:1-13 Nitog higap den navawē non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="ip">4:14 - 5:10 Tigsas nipris liwo mey a nitiy wē yeh</para>
  <para style="ip">5:11 - 6:12 Nitog sisgoy den nēdēmtig veg nēk tit van lokse vēhte me</para>
  <para style="ip">6:13-20 Gēn tēdēmtig vēh navatvat non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="ip">7:1-18 Tigsas nipris liwo qeleave</para>
  <para style="ip">8:3-10:18 Nolol non Tigsas so tamgoy nubug en, kē itōk veteg nolol non ige Juw</para>
  <para style="ip">10:19 Tigsas mal wak namtehal so gēn van sisqet hiy Ḡod</para>
  <para style="ip">10:26 Nēvēvēg non ige mey a kēy nepsipteg Ēntēn Ḡod</para>
  <para style="ip">10:31 Tig netnet qele am̄ag so lep nayseyse</para>
  <para style="ip">11:1-40 ?Nahap Nēdēmtig?</para>
  <para style="ip">12:1 Ak qele ige tam̄ag mey a mēdēmtig maymay</para>
  <para style="ip">12:7 Ḡod nivatne nēk qele imam vitwag nivatne ēntēn</para>
  <para style="ip">12:12 Tēy maymay vēlēs navatvatne mey nēwē</para>
  <para style="ip">12:18 Am̄ag ige Tisrael tit van sisqet vēhte hiy Ḡod veg kē noyon̄</para>
  <para style="ip">12:21 Gēn tavan sisqet vēh hiy Ḡod lemyeyen talge</para>
  <para style="ip">13:1 Nēmētwōn ige non Kraēs</para>
  <para style="ip">13:6 Matēg ēwē van hiy Tigsas, ba nitog matēg van Lele non ige Juw</para>
  <para style="ip">13:14 Vēwē wa ōliwo Ḡod heylō namgumgu mey nēwē</para>
  <para style="ip">14:20 Babah ne tatay</para>
  <para style="ip">14:22-25 Babah ne hohole</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod mohole me hiy ige Juw heylō Ēntēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Yēhē ige mino Tujuw. Me am̄ag yeh en, Ḡod mohole me hiy ige yatqōtqōngēn heylō ige et lēgēlgēg. Vag m̄adeg kēy mavasemlō van noyoy non Ḡod a lemtehal tegtegha. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Ba togtōkē, a sisqet babah ne qōn̄ en, Ḡod mohole me hiy gēn heylō Ēntēn. Ḡod mitin̄ namyam gōh heylō kē. Tō Ḡod metyak kē so kē nim̄agoy vel haphap del. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Tō Ēntēn nesben goy vel haphap del lemyam gōh mi naman ne hohole nonon. Tō nēlēn̄as non Ḡod nihin̄yeg heylō kē. Tō kē en nitiy totgal non Ḡod. Mahē kē mak wenwen bah ige nonon den nubug nonoy en, tō kē mēvēykal lok alge. Tō kē mahaghiy how letno liwo a lemtō non Ḡod a neketket yeh. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Tō Ēntēn Ḡod gōh mavan me nitiy ketket veteg ige in̄sel del. Wa tō nahah mey a Ḡod melep van hiy Ēntēn en, nahah nan neketket yeh den nahan ige in̄sel.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nayapyap Tēnēte nivasemlō so Ēntēn neketket veteg ige in̄sel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kē nim̄ōleg me so Ēntēn neketket den ige in̄sel veg Ḡod et vap te van hiy nin̄sel vitwag so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Inēk intik. Tō qiyig gōh en, nok van me Imam nōnōm.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 2:7</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Si so mavap se so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Ino Imam nonon, wa ikē Intik.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Samual 7:14, 1 Chronicles 17:13</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Nohohole gōh en, Ḡod mavap ēwē veg Ēntēn. <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Tō mahē a Ḡod mēvētleg me Ēntēn lemyam gōh, a nitiy Ēntēn a kē nam̄agoy vel haphap del, kē mavap so, “Yēhē ige in̄sel del non Ḡod, atmi mogmogo goy kē.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 32:43</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Tō Ḡod mohole gatay lokse ige in̄sel, qelegēn so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">No magaleg so ige in̄sel mino van me qeleso nelen̄,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">wa kēy yowyowveg mino qeleso nagayme ep.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 104:4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ba mahē Ḡod mohole veg Ēntēn en, kē wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Inēk Ḡod, inēk namyanag liwo, wa natno liwo ne mayanag nōnōm tit bah vēhte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">tō letno liwo nōnōm en, nēmētvu netgolgol hiy ige sil nōnōm.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Nēk temyōs nahaphap mey netnenen vēlēs, ba nēk tepsipteg nahaphap mey nehet.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Veg bege gōh en, ino, a Ḡod nōnōm, mal tan̄ōp nēk mi nisim yon̄ ne malaklak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">tō m̄ōk ketket nēk den ige viwti et nōnōm.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 45:6-7</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Tō Ḡod mavap lokse so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Welan, me am̄ag en, nēk mitin̄ nōtōti mayam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">wa tō nēk mitin̄ nahaphap hag lemyayawoy en mi namnē.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Vel haphap geh nen teqleqlen̄ qēt, qeleso namalmal mey a num̄usm̄us.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ba nēk tō lokveg yak kēy qeleso namalmal mahayhay busuwsuwyeg yak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">tō nēk teleh kēy.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Ba inēk en, nēk totogtog lap qelenen a tit leh vēhte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Wa n̄ēh en, nēh nōnōm tit bah vēhte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 102:25-27</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Ba Ḡod et vap hōnqal te van hiy nin̄sel vitwag nonon so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">Nēk haghiy letno liwo a lemtō mino, ba nēk dēyē</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">gaydēn̄ a nok m̄ōk tēqēl ige tavale nōnōm hōw antan, tō nēk tavayvay vēh apwoy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 110:1</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Ba kimi nēglal vatag so ige in̄sel en, kēy noyowyowveg non Ḡod. Tō kēy nuvu, a Ḡod mēvētleg kēy me so nimyin̄ ige et mey a kē tavaēh kēy.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod tēvēvēg ige mey a et yon̄teg te Welan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Veg bege gōh, itōk so gēn haldin̄qoy goy galsi nahap a gēn moyon̄teg veg gēn tiple vayak den.<verse eid="HEB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Dēmsas noyoy a ige in̄sel mavap lō me en, noyoy nan Nele non Ḡod. Tō kimi nēglal so vel helhele, wa nubug del gōh en, Ḡod telep van nēvēvēg a netgolgol bubug nan. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />?Sowo noyoy non in̄sel nēdēw qelegōh, ba qeleave boyoy non Welan? ?So gēn wo moqoywon galgal goy noyoy ēwē gōh, tō gēn titigoy vēh gēn den nēvēvēg gōh qeleave? Loyoy ēwē gōh en, Welan mahgen mavasemlō nitiy metehal bavavaēh et. Tō ige a moyon̄teg noyoy nan den kē en, kēy mavaplō me so ikē hēywē. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Tō Ḡod mahgen mavasemlō se so noyoy nan hēywē mi naman heylō woqse vēglal, wa woqse vahah a bamamakē. Wa tō heylō newē Vu Yon̄ tegtegha, a kē melep van tatag namyōs nonon.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod metyak Tigsas so nimyanag goy namyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Tō Ḡod et vonyak te ige in̄sel so kēy van me liwo goy namyam gayaq mey a vanvan lapgetō me en, a gēn hohole gatay tō agōh. Tateh.<verse eid="HEB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Ba nayapyap tege van Layapyap Yon̄ en mavap qelegēn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">?Ḡod, bahap tō net nitiy wē yeh van lengē?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">?Bahap tō nēk netgoy galgalsi ninti et nan?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Nēk mōm̄ōk tēqēl kē tusu ēwē leln̄an ige in̄sel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">tō me heygoy kē mi nēlēn̄as wa mi nēdēmap.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Tō nēk mōm̄ōk kē so kē nimyanag goy vel haphap, tō kē tavayvay vēh apwoy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 8:4-6</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Nohohole gōh mavap so Ḡod mōm̄ōk ige et so kēy mayanag goy “vel haphap,” nēdēmdēm nan so “vel haphap del,” tō tateh hap geh se a et leln̄an te. Ba togtōkē en, gēn et et hōn qete so ige et mayanag goy vel haphap del. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />!Ba Tigsas en, kē namyanag goy vel haphap del! Ḡod mak kē mēvēhgi et, mak tō kē motog natkelgi leln̄an ige in̄sel. Kē mak qelenen tō so Tigsas tamat wēl nisil del. Tō Tigsas me leh kēy den namatmat. Igōhkē nasgōp non Ḡod, a bemgaysēn. Tō me atgiy Ḡod me heygoy kē mi nēlēn̄as wa mi nēdēmap.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod mētēymat galsi Tigsas so nivaēh ige et</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Ḡod mitin̄ vel haphap del, tō vel haphap del telep nēlēn̄as lok van hiy kē. Tō kē nemyōs so nivēl m̄adeg me yantēntēn, so kēy van me qultiwag van lēlēn̄as talge nonon. Ba net a tavaēh ige del en, itōk so kē nivan me nam̄e et yeh. Tō Ḡod mōm̄ōk Tigsas so nivaēh kēy. Tō Ḡod mētēymat kē heylō lemtehal ne yon̄memeh. Nēdēmdēm nan so Tigsas nesey so nivaēh yantēntēn Ḡod veg kē moyon̄memeh.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Tigsas mak yon̄ yantēntēn Ḡod. Tō Tigsas tiwag mi kēy en, kēy del niginwotwot vitwag woy. Veg bege gōh en, Tigsas et mamayge te so niōl kēy so ikēy yathēthēn wa tētētan.<verse eid="HEB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Tō kē mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">Ḡod, no tavasemlō nahe van hiy ige yathithik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">tō no tese neh bōl liwo nēk lēvēwti tēlēm̄ yon̄ nōnōm.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 22:22</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Tō kē mavap lokse so, “No tēdēmtig kē.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 8:17</char></note> Tō kē mavap lokse so, “Ino agōh, tiwag mi ige nētnētm̄ey a Ḡod melep me.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 8:18 </char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas temyin̄ vēh gēn veg kē mēvēhge et qele igēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14-15" />Ige nētnētm̄ey nan, kēy net ēwē, nataqn̄ēy wa naday nonoy aē. Tō ige et, kēy nemtēgteg namatmat. Veg bege gōh, Satan tēyēt vēh kēy, veg kē namaymay buwuhwuh mat et. Mak tō lēh del nonoy en, qeleso kēy notogtog lēm̄ yētyēt non Satan. Ba Tigsas mavan me so nilalaket goy Satan. Kē mēvēhgi et, mi nataqn̄ēn, tō kē mamat. Ba namatmat non Tigsas mak so namaymay non Satan en yeghuquy ēwē. Togtōkē, Tigsas mukēg taywah ige a memtēgteg tō, a kēy motog tō lēm̄ yētyēt non Satan.<verse eid="HEB 2:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Gēn nēglal galsi so Tigsas et van te me so nimyin̄ ige in̄sel, ba kē mēvēhgi et so nimyin̄ ige ginwotwot non Abraham.<verse eid="HEB 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Veg bege gōh, kē mavan me mahaytēyēh galsi qele yathēthēn wa yatētētan, tō so kē tavan vēh me nam̄e pris liwo. Tō kē nam̄e pris a namgaysēn aē mi kē, wa kē neskalgoy galsi namgumgu non Ḡod. Namgumgu nan so kē nitamgoy negengenyeg a kēy mak tō.<verse eid="HEB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Tō kē temyin̄ vēh ige mey a nem̄eygal taqal kēy, veg kē mahgen moyon̄teg tō nememeh mahē a nem̄eygal maqal kē.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas neketket den Mosis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Yēhē yaplupluk lēvēwti et a Ḡod mōlōl gēn, yathithik wa yatētētek yon̄, dēmsas vaga Tigsas. Kē nahal wa nipris liwo nongēn, mey a gēn vavasemlō vaga so gēn nēdēmtig kē. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Kē natatagoy galsi namgumgu a Ḡod metyak tō kē aē, qeleaso Mosis memgumgu galsi tō hiy Ḡod. Ige non Ḡod en, qeleso kēy del notogtog lēm̄ nonon. Tō Ḡod metyak Mosis so nietgoy ige a lēm̄ nonon. Ba Tigsas en, ikē a mowos tō nēm̄ non Ḡod en.<verse eid="HEB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Tō Ḡod met so nahan Tigsas neketket den nahan Mosis. ?Gēn so ōlwē net beteytey ēm̄, siso ōlwē nēm̄ a net nan metey kal tō en? <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Woqse ēm̄, wa woqse et a mowos kal nēm̄ en, ba Ḡod mahgen mitin̄ nahaphap del lemyam. Bastō nahan Tigsas neketket den nahan Mosis veg Ḡod mitin̄ tō namyam heylō Tigsas.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Tō natno liwo non Tigsas neketket yeh den natno liwo non Mosis. Veg Mosis en, kē net bemgumgu lēm̄ non Ḡod, ba Tigsas nitiy et benon ēm̄. Mosis gōh, kē neskalgoy galsi namgumgu a Ḡod melep van hiy kē. Namgumgu namun en, kē net lēgēlgēg bētēytēymat ige sil boyoy a so Ḡod tavasemlō me atgiy. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ba Kraēs en, kē Ēntēn Ḡod, tō Ḡod mōm̄ōk kē so nim̄agoy ige sil del lēm̄ nonon. Tō kē neskalgoy namyōs non Ḡod. Tō gēn se ige non Ḡod a notog lēm̄ nonon. Ba gēn so dēmtig navatvat nonon wa nitog mētēgteg. !Gēn dēmdēyē navatvat nonon wa sēsē gēn aē!<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yon̄teg Ḡod, tō nitog qētqēt maymay qele ige Juw n̄a lepnō vadalm̄eg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Bastō, qele Nuvu Yon̄ mavap en, so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">!Qiyig gōh, mahē kimi yon̄teg naln̄an Ḡod en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:7">atmi yon̄teg ba dēmap!<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />Amtan Ḡod wo, “Nitog so niqtimi nimaymay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">qele mahē kimi mavan yak den Itsip,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">tō van soloteg hiy mahē van lepnō vadalm̄eg.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Vētmahē nen ige yatqōtqōmi met namakaliw a no mak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ba kēy mehelhel nele tasga hiy no bēte son̄wul vet.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Veg bege gōh en, no mololgagay kēy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">tō mavap so, ‘Natqay et sewsew te hiy no vaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">tō kēy et ēglal m̄ōleg te nēmētwuk.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />No mololgagay yeh kēy wa mōm̄ōk nēvēn̄vēn̄ van hiy kēy so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">kēy tit hayveg vēhte van lepnō tog m̄ōkheg mino.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 95:7-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek, etgoy nalotaqami den negengenyeg, ba dēmtig Ḡod mey a nēh, tō so kimi tit tigkēlē vēhte kē. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Veg nem̄eygal tiple galgal kimi, tō niqtimi tiple maymay aē. Bastō atmi hole vēybiyin̄ kimi qiyig wa vel qōn̄ del.<verse eid="HEB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Veg igēn tavan me yaplōplōn Kraēs, so gēn wo tig maymay gaydēn̄ lōlsē ēh nongēn. Dēmtig maymay tasga qeleso gēn mowowtēyak tō me am̄ag.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Yēhē no mal hole vatag se so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">!Qiyig gōh, mahē kimi yon̄teg naln̄an Ḡod en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">atmi yon̄teg ba dēmap!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">Nitog so niqtimi nimaymay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">qele mahē kimi mavan yak den Itsip.<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />?Kē nivap veg “ige a moyon̄teg ba kēy nēqēt maymay,” wo kē nihole gatay ihē? Kē nihole gatay ige a Mosis mitig helem̄ag tō kēy den Itsip. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />?Ba Ḡod mololgagay tō ihē bēte son̄wul vet? Ige mey a kēy megengenyeg, tō kēy matmat ganwon lepnō vadalm̄eg. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />?Tō ihē geh a Ḡod mal m̄ōk nēvēn̄vēn̄ so kēy tit hayveg vēhte van lepnō tog m̄ōkheg nonon? Ige mey a kēy et yon̄teg te kē. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Bastō gēn mal m̄ōleg aē veg kēy, so ige mey a et dēmtig te en, kēy tit hayveg vēhte lepnō tog m̄ōkheg.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">Ige mey dēmtig Ḡod en, kēy tavan vēh lemyeyen talge so tog m̄ōkheg tiwag mi kē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Ḡod mal vēyvēyne vatag lavatvat nonon, a gēn tavan vēh mahē nonon so tog m̄ōkheg tiwag mi kē. Tō itōk so gēn mētēgtegoy, ba etgoy galsi, veg nehet so gēn tuwtuw den, tō gēn tit kalbat vēhte tiwag mi kē. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Veg noyoy ēwē maqal gēn, qele maqal ige yatqōtqōngēn. Ba noyoy nan yeghuquy van hiy kēy, veg kēy et dēmtig te noyoy nan. Bastō kēy et qultiwag te mi nēvēwti et mey a moyon̄teg.<verse eid="HEB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ba gēn mey a nēdēmtig, gēn tahayveg van lamahē nonon a kē tog m̄ōkheg tō aē so tog malaklak, qele a Ḡod mavasemlō tō en so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">No mololgagay yeh kēy wa mōm̄ōk nēvēn̄vēn̄ van hiy kēy so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">kēy tit hayveg vēhte van lepnō tog m̄ōkheg mino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 95:11</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:3">Ḡod mavap qele gōh, ba mahē a kē mitin̄ bah namyam gōh en, tō namgumgu namun mabah qēt.<verse eid="HEB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Nayapyap Tēnēte nihole gatay nōqōn̄ m̄ōkheg, so, “Lōqōn̄ liviyō en, Ḡod mōm̄ōkheg den vel mugumgu namun.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ba mahē tegha Layapyap Tēnēte Ḡod wo, “Kēy tit hayveg vēhte van lepnō tog m̄ōkheg mino.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Nēdēmdēm nan so igōhkē nēvēwti vōyō, yatkelgi mey a tavan lepnō tog m̄ōkheg, wa ige vēwti mey a kēy moyon̄teg noyoy ēwē wa kēy et tatag te, tō kēy tit kalbat vēhte lepnō tog m̄ōkheg. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Lēklan me atgiy, Ḡod metyak nōqōn̄ tegha so kalbat lepnō tog m̄ōkheg tiwag mi kē. Kē m̄ōl van nōqōn̄ nan so ‘qiyig agōh.’ Kē mavap nohohole nen heylō me den Mayanag Devēt, qele no mal hole vatag se so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">!Qiyig gōh, mahē kimi yon̄teg naln̄an Ḡod en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">nitog so niqtimi nimaymay.<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Napnō tog m̄ōkheg en, kē et napnō non ige Juw te, mey a Josua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Josua en, ikē net a mitig helem̄ag tō ige Juw a lēklan Mosis. Josua mitig helem̄ag ige Juw tō mēdēn̄ van lepnō nonoy. Nakaka nonon lōbōk Josua a Layapyap Tēnēte.</char></note> mepgal veg tō en. Veg Josua melep tō napnō nan van hiy ige Juw am̄ag yeh den Devēt. Sowo natno tog m̄ōkheg en napnō non ige Juw vēlēs, tō Ḡod tit hole gatay vēhte napnō nan lok me atgiy, mahē a Devēt nēh.<verse eid="HEB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Veg bege gōh Ḡod metyak napnō tog m̄ōkheg hiy ige nonon, tō so kēy totog m̄ōkheg aē qele kē mōm̄ōkheg tō lōqōn̄ liviyō, a nitiy qōn̄ nonon. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Ihēte a nihayveg hay lepnō tog m̄ōkheg non Ḡod en, kēy m̄ōkheg den namgumgu nonoy, qele Ḡod mōm̄ōkheg tō den namgumgu nonon.<verse eid="HEB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Veg bege gōh en, itōk so gēn mugumgu mi nēhyēngēn so hayveg lepnō m̄ōkheg, tō so tateh et tisisgoy lēmētwun ige tam̄ag mey a nēqēt maymay.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod netgeh vel haphap a gēn akak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Veg Ḡod netgeh gēn. Tō nohohole nonon nēh, wa naman aē. Tō nohohole gōh nehey veteg nagasel bepgal a nehey salakyō. Tō kē tēvēlwoywoy vēh vel dēmdēm wa vel mētwuge, tō tēvēvēg vēh, qeleso nagasel a teplēh yak vēh nēphog den nihiy. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Vel haphap del a Ḡod mitin̄ tō en, kē netsas, tō tateh hap mey a natakbat den kē. Tō gēn titig van lengon so vulu kē bēh nongēn.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas, ikē nitiy Pris Liwo nongēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Bahnentō, itōk so gēn tig maymay lēdēmdēm nongēn, lahap a gēn mavaplō tō so gēn ige non Tigsas. Veg Tigsas en, ikē Ēntēn Ḡod, wa kē nam̄e pris liwo a mēvēykal lok lōtōk alge. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Mahē a gēn nem̄geygey en, nipris liwo nongēn memgaysēn gēn, veg kē mavan heylō temun tō nem̄eygal del. Ba tateh bug geh mi kē. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Sōwlē, gēn tog mētēgteg so van sisqet Ḡod a letno haghag liwo nonon. Veg leln̄e magaysēn nonon en, gēn tetsas vēh nasgōp aē, tō kē temyin̄ vēh gēn.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod mal ōl Tigsas so kē nipris liwo qele Melkēsēdek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Gēn mal ēglal vatag nēmētwōn ige Pris Liwo. Vaga en, Ḡod nietyak net vitwag den ige tam̄an, tō nim̄ōk kal kē, so nimgumgu van lengon Ḡod a lahay del. Nipris Liwo gōh nilep van nolol hiy Ḡod, wa kē niolol mi nisipsip tō so nitamgoy negengenyeg non ige sil. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Kē nemhuy hiy ige mey a et mēnay te wa mavan ley den namtehal tenenen, veg kē se nem̄geygey. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Ba veg kē se nem̄geygey en, kē nolol mi nisipsip veg bubug nagan mahgen qele kē nolol bubug nagan ige sil.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Ḡod mahgen tetyak net so nivan me nipris liwo, qeleso Ḡod metyak tō Aron, a kē nipris liwo totogyeg leln̄an Mosis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aron, ikē ēthēn Mosis. Ḡod mōlōl Aron so nivan me Nipris Liwo totogyeg. Numbers 28</char></note> Ba net vitwag tit etyak vēhte kē mahgen so nilep natno liwo nan. Tateh. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ba veg Kraēs en, qeleanen. Kē et m̄ōk te kē mahgen so nilep nahah a so nivan me Nipris Liwo, tateh. Ḡod mahgen mōm̄ōk kal kē, ba mavap van hiy kē so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Inēk Intik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Qiyig gōh nok van me tiy Imam nōnōm.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 2:7</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ba Layapyap Yon̄ vitwag se, mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">Inēk nipris a tit bah vēhte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">qeleso nēmētwun Melkēsēdek, a kē nam̄e pris tam̄ag.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 14:17-24</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Lamahē a Kraēs notog me lemyam gōh en, kē matatay so Ḡod nimyin̄ kē, wa natn̄ēh molon̄ den namtan. Kē mayayah ōlōl beten̄ten̄ hiy Ḡod a tavaēh vēh kē den namatmat. Tō Ḡod moyon̄teg kē veg kē mataqlun̄ goy Ḡod mi nēdēmap. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Tigsas ikē Ēntēn Ḡod ba namtehal nonon et towoyig te. Heylō nahaphap a mak tō kē moyon̄memeh lataqn̄ēn en, kē mavatne naln̄e yon̄teg. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Mahē kē mēdēn̄ lōlsi metehal nan, kē mavan me nitiy et bavavaēh ige et den namatmat. Tō ikē mavan me nōtōti ēh lap hiy ige mey a yon̄yon̄teg kē. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Tō Ḡod mal ōl Tigsas so kē nipris liwo qele Melkēsēdek a nam̄e pris tam̄ag.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nohohole so ak matyak kēy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Kemem so hole woqse haphap veg bege agōh. Ba nemeh so vasem m̄ōleg van hiy kimi, veg kimi navatne meyemyen̄ ēwē. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Entō gōh kimi so vatne ige tegha ēgēn, ba tateh. Itōk so navatgo nivatne lokse kimi bohohole non Ḡod a niqtēg lokse a lōtōtēn. Kimi qeleso nētnētm̄ey a sisis laptō, ba et gengen te negengen maymay.<verse eid="HEB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ige nētnētm̄ey mey a sisis lapgetō en, ikēy qeleso ige et mey a et ēglal galsi qete navatvatne bemtehal tenenen. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ba negengen maymay en, nagan ige mey a mal tamta vatag, veg kēy mal ēglal yak tō me so nēwē ave si nehet ave.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod tavawē ige et mey kēy yon̄teg navatvatne wa mugumgu mi navaksay, ba kē tēvēvēg ige mey kēy gesges den</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Gēn tit qētēg lok vēhte lōtōti vatvatne tegtegha veg Kraēs. Navatvatne nan qeleso gēn dēmleh den namgumgu yeghuquy mey a gēn tamat vēh aē, ba dēmtig Ḡod tō so kē nivaēh gēn, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />si navatvatne ne vasugyon̄, so batan̄tan̄ apwo et bavavawē, si bahahatig lok den namatmat, tiwag mi nēvēvēg bamatmat lap. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Vel haphap geh nen qeleso nōtōti ēm̄, ba gēn so tigtēy lap. Tō gēn galeg, sowo lemyōs non Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Gēn so tigtēy maymay lap veg net mey a kē nigesges tō niukēg veteg nēdēmtig gōh en, kē tit van lok vēhte me. Dēmsas tow net vitwag a mavan me net non Kraēs. Kē mal van me lemyeyen, kē mal helet etgal navawē den alge, kē mal gen vatag nēwē non Ḡod. Wa kē may lep Nuvu Yon̄. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Kē metet tō naman ne meyeyen talge, wa metsas tō so nohohole non Ḡod nitiy wē yeh. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Bastō me atgiy en, kē nitig kēlē Kraēs. !Ba net qelegōh, kē tit dēmleh lokse vēhte! Veg mahē a kē niak qele gōh en, qeleso kē niwos mahgen Ēntēn Ḡod lokse lowolwol, wa niak mamayge Ēntēn lengon ige sil.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Dēmsas tow nēvētan vitwag. Nasm̄al mesm̄al how aē, tō kē niyip qēt nēbē. Tō nēvētan nan niak navavah nimtow galgalsi van hiy ige a mavah tō en. Tō Ḡod tavawē nēvētan nan. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ba nēvētan a nowolkokon̄ay wa naplih het nimtow alon en, Ḡod qoyo vipdeg nēvētan nan. Veg nēvētan nan tateh wē geh aē, tō lōlsēn yow en, kēy teben nep van aē.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Yēhē yaplupluk, kemem mohole qeleagōh, ba veg kimi en, kemem nēglal so kimi damdam namtehal mey nēwē, a namtehal bavavaēh. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nēmētwumi mavasemlō tō so kimi natam Ḡod, veg kimi memyin̄ tō ige nonon, wa tō kimi biyin̄ leptō kēy. Ḡod en, namtevun netnenen, tō kē tit dēm veteg vēhte namgumgu ēwē nonmi.<verse eid="HEB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Tō kemem nemyōs so kimi vivitwag tigtēy lap navaksami, tō tig maymay lēdēmdēm nonmi so dēmdēyē beyseyse dēn̄ van lōlsi ēh. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Kemem et buste so kimi meyemyen̄. Ba atmi ak tatag ige mey a mitig maymay so dēmtig Ḡod tō melep navawē aē. Navawē nan nahap a Ḡod mavatvat tō van hiy ige bōbō tam̄ag.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Navatvat non Ḡod tit sisgoy vēhte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Dēmsas Abraham, kē melep navatvat den Ḡod. Mahē Ḡod mavatvat van hiy Abraham en, kē mohole gontegoy kē mahgen so niak dēw navatvat nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 22:15-18</char></note> Veg tateh et se a nilwo den kē so nihole gontegoy kē aē. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Tō navatvat gōh kē mavap so, “No tavawē tō tavawē nēk, tō no tak nēk tavan me tam̄adeg wewti.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Bahnentō Abraham mēdēmdēyē bege gōh, gaydēn̄ a kē mētēy nahap a Ḡod mavatvat tō.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Mahē net vitwag nemyōs so niak dēw nohohole nonon en, kē nigatgoy lahah vitwag mey a neketket yeh. Tō nahah nan haytēyēh so ōl gontegoy kē. Veg kē mal ōl gontegoy galsi lengon net liwo en, tateh vēyvēyle lokse me atgiy. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Bastō, mahē Ḡod memyōs so niak dēw navatvat nonon, kē magatgoy lahah a neketket. Nohohole nan nivasemlō so kē tit leh vēhte nēdēmdēm nonon veg bavatvat nan. Tō ige mey a tog dēyē navatvat nan en, kēy nēglal galsi so navatvat nan taktig.<verse eid="HEB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Veg Ḡod melep me hiy gēn nage vōyō so vahiy maymay gēn so dēmdēyē bavatvat nonon. Nage vōyō gōh nohohole ne vatvat tiwag mi nohohole ne gatgoy. Tō nohohole vōyō gōh tit leh vēhte, veg tateh galgal mi Ḡod. Gēn mey a mal valag van hiy Ḡod so kē nitigoy gēn, navatvat gōh tak muhuy gēn. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Veg gēn dēmdēyē navatvat non Ḡod, tō nalo taqangēn tahag hotog. Nēdēmdēyē nan qeleso nevetlēg a gēn til veteg mahē a noyoyōm̄. Wa gēn dēmdēyē so Tigsas niaktig navatvat non Ḡod. Tigsas mavan heylō nidin a Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nidin a Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leves gōh nihole gatay nahap mey alon Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod. Hebrews 9:2-3 nikaka se veg nidin nan. Mahē Tigsas mamat en, namalmal a nadam goy nahyan Ḡod en, kē memhaywoy. Matthew 27:51, Mark 15:38, Luke 23:45</char></note>, nididin nan namalmal a nadam goy nahyan Ḡod mey noyon̄ a noyon̄. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Kē mak qelenen so nitig leh gēn van lengon Ḡod. Tō kē mal van me nam̄e Pris Liwo qele Melkēsēdek a nipris tam̄ag, tō kē tētēy tasga namgumgu qelenen tit bah vēhte.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Nipris Liwo tam̄ag a Melkēsēdek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Dēm tow van nakaka veg Abraham kōyō Melkēsēdek.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 14:14-20</char></note> Vag tiwag Abraham mepgapgal tiwag mi yatkel mayanag tegtegha. Tō Abraham malalaket goy kēy, tō melepyak qēt namlay den kēy. Mahē Abraham mōm̄ōl lok me den napgal nan en, kē metsas Melkēsēdek. Melkēsēdek gōh, kē namyanag liwo lelqelqevōnō Salem, wa kē nipris non Ḡod a neketket yeh. Tō Melkēsēdek mavawē Abraham. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Wa tō Abraham mohog natayt van hiy Melkēsēdek. Nahah a Melkēsēdek en, nēdēmdēm nan alon so “Mayanag mey a netnenen lengon Ḡod.” Wa tō nahah vōyō negi en, so “Mayanag Tasalem,” nēdēmdēm nan so, “Mayanag ne Tam̄at.”<verse eid="HEB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Melkēsēdek en, tateh et vitwag so niglal imam wa tita nonon, wa tateh et vitwag niglal so kē mowot tō an̄ēh, si so mamat tō an̄ēh. Nayapyap yon̄ gōh nihole gatay kē qeleso kē tahag lap letno Pris Liwo. Bastō kē qeleso Ēntēn Ḡod a totogtog lap vaga.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melkēsēdek neketket veteg Abraham wa ige pris Tujuw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />!Et tow van hiy Melkēsēdek en, ikē neketket a neketket yeh! Tamayge Abraham mohog van hiy kē namlan vivitwag den son̄son̄wul den nahaphap a kē melep mimiy ēwē tō.<verse eid="HEB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Gēn mal ēglal nēvēnan ige Juw so hog van namlay vivitwag hiy ige pris. Ige sil Tujuw tiwag mi ige non Levi mey a kēy nipris en, kēy del ige ginwotwot non Abraham. Ba Mosis mal ōl gontegoy ige non Levi so lep namlay den ige yathēthēy. Ige pris gōh netegha den Melkēsēdek. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Veg Melkēsēdek et van tabay te me den Levi. Ba kē melep namlay vivitwag den son̄son̄wul gōh den Abraham. Tō kē mavawē Abraham a Ḡod mal vatvat vatag van hiy kē. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Tō gēn del nēglal so net liwo tavawē vēh net mey a antan den kē.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Togtōkē ige pris mey a kēy lep namlay vivitwag en, ikēy tamat vēh veg ikēy net. Ba Melkēsēdek en, Nayapyap Yon̄ nivasemlō so kē totog ēh lap.<verse eid="HEB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Levi en, kē nileplep me namlan den ige sil. Ba mahē Abraham mohog namlan hiy Melkēsēdek en, mey gōh qeleso Levi mahgen mohog van namlan heylō Abraham. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Veg Levi niginwotwot non Abraham. Bastō Melkēsēdek neketket den Levi.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige pris a mavan tabay me den Levi, wa nipris a nētēy goy nēmētwun Melkēsēdek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Namgumgu namun ige pris so ak tenenen ige sil lengon Ḡod. Ige pris a mavan tabay me den Levi am̄ag en, kēy so tak galsi tō en, togtō gēn tit mōyōs vēhte nipris tegha. Ba veg kēy et haytēyēh te, tō Ḡod metyak Nipris Liwo gayaq qeleso Melkēsēdek. Aron, ikē nipris totogyeg a mavan me den Levi. Mahē a letno liwo non Aron en, Ḡod melep van Nele hiy Mosis so qeleave namgumgu namun ige pris. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Tō mahē a nipris tegha nivan me en, tō nele nen teleh lokse.<verse eid="HEB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Gēn hole tō gōh veg nipris gayaq en, kē et van tabay te me den Levi, tateh, kē mavan tabay me den ēthēn Levi, a Juda. Wa tateh ginwotwot non Juda a memgumgu tō lolta. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Welan, ikē niginwotwot non Juda, tō Mosis et hole sas te van nipris a so tavan me den Juda.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas qele Melkēsēdek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Wa tō, nim̄ōleg so nele teleh lokse, sowo nipris gayaq tavan me lemtehal non Melkēsēdek. Veg namtehal gōh netegha den namtehal non Aron. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ige non Aron mavan me ige pris heylō nele a mavap so ige ginwotwot nonon vēlēs tavan me ige pris. Ba Welan mavan me nipris heylō lamaymay ne ēh nonon a tit bah vēhte. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap aē so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">Inēk nipris a tit bah vēhte qeleso nēmētwun Melkēsēdek.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Inēk nipris a tit bah vēhte qeleso nēmētwun Melkēsēdek. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Sam 110:4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Nele tam̄ag nem̄geygey wa tateh wē nan geh, veg kē tit ak tenenen vēhte net so nitig van lengon Ḡod. Bastō Ḡod mōm̄ōk yak nele nan, <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />tō mawak namtehal tegha a so gēn tavan sisqet vēh hiy kē aē. Namtehal nan nitiy wē yeh, tō gēn m̄ōk nēdēmdēm nongēn nitig maymay van aē.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod metyak Tigsas so kē nipris liwo, tō kē tit lēh vēhte nēdēmdēm nonon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Ḡod metyak nipris gayaq mi navatvat vitwag. Ba ige pris tam̄ag en, kēy mavan me ige pris heylō namtehal ne Le, ba et namtehal ne vatvat te. Navatvat nitiy wē yeh den namtehal ne Le. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Veg Ḡod mavatvat wa mōl gontegoy so nim̄ōk Tigsas nipris liwo. Ḡod mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Welan Ḡod mōl gontegoy kē mahgen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">tō kē tit leh vēhte nēdēmdēm nonon, so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Inēk nipris a tit bah vēhte.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Sam 110:4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Veg bege gōh en, Tigsas mavan me so niaktig nakavanan mey a nitiy wē yeh den nakavanan tam̄ag.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas en, kē nipris liwo nongēn a neketket yeh den ige pris lililwo tam̄ag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Tigsas kē nitiy pris liwo nongēn, tō tateh hap so nilep yak kē den namgumgu nan. Ba ige pris tam̄ag en, kēy ige et ēwē, tō namatmat ēwē telep yak kēy den natno liwo ne pris liwo. Veg mahē nipris liwo vitwag nimat en, net tegha teleh kē. Mak tō am̄ag ige m̄adeg mavan me nipris liwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ba Tigsas tēh lap, tō kē nitiy pris liwo tasga qelenen, a tateh ōlsēn geh. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Veg bege gōh, ihēte a nivan sisqet Ḡod heylō Tigsas en, Tigsas tavaēh lap kē, veg Tigsas titig lap lengon Ḡod so nivēhge Ḡod so nimgaysēn kē. Tigsas temyin̄ lap kē vaga veg nēh non Tigsas tit bah vēhte.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Tigsas ikē nitiy pris liwo veg kē noyon̄, wa tateh gengenyeg geh mi kē. Kē newenwen a newenwen. !Kē nam̄e et tenenen so nimyin̄ gēn! Tō Ḡod melep ha kē den ige gengenyeg, tō melep kal kē hag lōtōk. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Tō Tigsas et qele te ige pris lililwo tam̄ag a kēy olol vag m̄adeg. Ige Pris nan melep van nolol velqōn̄ so tamgoy nubug. Am̄ag kē molol mi nōbōlōk veg nubug nagan, tō me atgiy kē molol mi nani veg nubug nagan ige sil.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Leviticus 9:7</char></note> Ba Tigsas en, kē melep kal nolol nonon vag tiwag woy ēwē. Tō nolol nan et sipsip te, ba kē mukēg nēh nonon mahgen so nitamgoy matm̄ēt nubug nagan ige sil. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Veg Nele non Mosis movonyak ige m̄egeygey wa ige gengenyeg so van me nipris liwo. Ba lēklan me atgiy en, navatvat non Ḡod so kē tetyak Ēntēn a netnenen a notogtog lap vaga, tō nivonyak kē so nivan me nam̄e pris liwo.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas ikē nipris liwo nongēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Sōwlē, igōhkē namanig ne hohole nonmem, Kraēs nam̄e pris liwo nongēn. Tō hag lōtōk alge en, kē nahag letno liwo a lemtō non Ḡod a Nitiy Man. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Kē nimgumgu lelo ēm̄ tēvēlgapye alge. Ḡod mahgen mētēymat nahaphap lelo ēm̄ tēvēlgapye nan. Net et tēymat te tō.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Namgumgu namun ige pris del en so hog van nalen̄a tiwag mi nolol. Veg bege gōh, nam̄e pris gōh so nilep temun hap se van hiy Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />So Kraēs wo totog lapgetō me lemyam gōh en, togtō kē tit van vēhte me nipris veg woqse pris tog vatag tō en. Kēy lep van nolol hiy Ḡod tatag van nele vayēg non Mosis. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Kēy mugumgu lelo ēm̄ tēvēlgapye mey a kēy mak tatag ēwē qeleso nēm̄ tēvēlgapye talge. Nēm̄ tēvēlgapye lemyam gōh en, ikē nototgal wa nēnēnēn ēwē. Nitiy ēm̄ tēvēlgapye non Ḡod n̄a lōtōk. Igōhkē nēhēyhēywē, veg mahē Mosis nitēytēymat so nigilgeg nēm̄ tēvēlgapye nan en, Ḡod mavap so, “Nēk tēymat galsi vel haphap del gōh qele a no mal vasemlō vatag van hiy nēk hag luwutwut alge en.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">“Nēk tēymat galsi vel haphap del gōh qele a no mal vasemlō vatag van hiy nēk hag luwutwut alge en.” </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 25:40</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ba togtōkē namgumgu non Kraēs nitiy wē yeh den namgumgu namun ige pris tam̄ag, qeleaso nakavanan nonon Tigsas nitiy wē yeh den nakavanan tam̄ag. Veg nahaphap a Ḡod mavatvat heylō Tigsas en, kēy itōk veteg navatvat tam̄ag.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod so leh nakavanan tam̄ag mi nakavanan gayaq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Nakavanan tam̄ag mavan heylō me Mosis. So nakavanan nan tēwē tō en, togtō tateh kavanan tegha se. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ba Ḡod mitil bōwōn ige sil veg kēy et tatag te nele ne kavanan nan. Tō Ḡod mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Welan Ḡod vap so, “!Yēhē! Mahē vanvan tege tō en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">a no qoyo lep nakavanan gayaq van hiy ige ginwotwot Tisrael</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">wa hiy ige ginwotwot Tujuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leves gōh nihole gatay ige ginwotwot Tisrael tiwag mi ige ginwotwot Tujuda. Ba kōyō vitwag ēwē. Nahah vōyō gōh so hole gatay ige Juw. </char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ba et qele te nakavanan a no melep tō van hiy ige tamatmayge nonoy.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Lamahē nen no mētēy namney, tō melep lō kēy den Itsip,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">ba kēy et dēmap te nakavanan nan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">tō veg bege gōh en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ino Welan, tō no mavap so no tit dēmsas se vēhte kēy.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Bastō nakavanan gayaq a no telep van hiy ige ginwotwot Tisrael en, qelegēn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">No tōm̄ōk nele mino lēdēmdēm nonoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">tō no tayap van lelo taqay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Tō no tavan me Ḡod nonoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">wa tō kēy tavan me ige mino.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Tō tateh et se tavatne ēthēn si so ige telepnō nonon a so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Ey, nēk van me ēglal Ḡod.’ Tateh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Veg ige del qēt tēglal no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">teqtēg mi ige woywoy, dēn̄ ige a neketket yeh.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Veg no temgaysēn kēy wa tēdēmveteg nēmgōy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">wa negengenyeg nonoy, no tit dēmsas lok vēhte.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jeremiah 31:31-34</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mahē a Ḡod mohohole gatay nakavanan gayaq gōh en, nēdēmdēm nan so nakavanan tam̄ag mal leh. Tō nahaphap tēnēte mey mal leh en, sisqet niqleqlen̄.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Nakavanan tam̄ag mōl vayēg ige Juw so lep van nolol m̄adeg Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Hēywē, nakavanan tam̄ag mōlvayēg so nēm̄ yon̄ aē lemyam gōh mey a nēm̄ tēvēlgapye, wa tō so ige Juw taqlun̄ goy Ḡod qeleave. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Ige tam̄ag mētēymat nahye olol qelegēn. Kēy migilgeg nēm̄ tēvēlgapye vitwag a nidinlat aē vōyō. Nidin mey am̄ag en, kēy ōl so Mahē Yon̄. Lidin gōh, nuqul vitwag aē, nolta, wa nēbrēyt vawē. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Tō kēy midin goy nidin gōh mi namalmal vitwag. Tō tekel malmal en, nidin vōyō negi a kēy ōl so Mahē Yon̄ a Noyon̄. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Hay lelo din gōh en, nolta vitwag aē wa nabakōs ne kavanan. Nolta nan bihilhil tēnge qōnqōn. Kēy mak nolta nan mi nōḡōl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 9:4">Nabakōs yon̄, kēy nuqul walēg mi nōḡōl. Ba hay lelo bakōs nan en nage vētēl alon. Vitwag natbey a mak mi nōḡōl ba namana nahag alon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">namana nahag alon. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namana nan en, kē negengen vitwag mey a Ḡod melep van hiy ige Juw vel qōn̄ mahē a kēy mavanvan walēg lepnō vadalm̄eg. Exodus 16:31-35</char></note> Vōyō negi en, nēqētōwtōw non Aron mey a nakaskas mataw den.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Numbers 17:8-11</char></note> Tō vētēl negi nan nevet teqetqen̄ a mayap Nele non Ḡod apwon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 10:1-5, Exodus 25:16</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Apwo bakōs yon̄ nan en, nototgal vōyō qeleso nin̄sel a kēy mitin̄ mi nōḡōl. Kōyō aklō me nēlēn̄as non Ḡod, ba namneyō nemelmelgoy namte bakōs nan. Kēy ōl namte bakōs nan natno dēmveteg bug. Ba gēn tit vasemlō qēt vēhte qiyig vel haphap del anen.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Mahē a vel haphap mētēymat qēt hay lēm̄ tēvēlgapye en, nidin mey am̄ag nahyan ige pris. Tō kēy hayveg hay tō mugumgu vel qōn̄ qeleanen. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ba vag tiwag woy ēwē vel ēte nipris liwo mahgen nihayveg lidin vōyō negi nan. Mahē kē nihayveg hay en, kē nētēy nivinlah a naday ne sipsip alon en. Tō kē niolol van hiy Ḡod mi naday ne sipsip. Ba sowo tateh day, tō kē tit hayveg vēhte hay. Veg naday gōh so nitamgoy nubug nagan wa nagan ige sil mey a kēy mak tō ba kēy et ēglal te aē.<verse eid="HEB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Nuvu Yon̄ nivasemlō so nahaphap geh gōh qeleso navap tēngeg. Namanig nan so lamahē a nēm̄ tēvēlgapye et leh yak qete en, namtehal hay Mahē Yon̄ et wak te hiy nisil. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Nēm̄ tēvēlgapye en, ikē nēvēglal ēwē ne mugumgu del non ige pris mey a kēy olol tatag van Nele non Mosis gaydēn̄ me qiyig kē. Nalen̄a tiwag mi nolol mey a ige pris olol aē en, kē et haytēyēh te so niak wenwen nēdēmdēm non net den namamayge ne bug. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Veg Nele nan nivap gatay ēwē begengen, wa binin, wa so net nivasugyon̄ qeleave. Meygōh nahaphap ne taqn̄ige ēwē. Ba nele geh nen totog lap gaydēn̄ a Ḡod nileh kēy mi namtehal mey negyaq.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakavanan gayaq a Tigsas melep van nolol vitwag woy lengon Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Togtōkē Kraēs mal van me, kē mal lep me nahaphap mey nēwē. Kē nipris liwo lelo tiy ēm̄ tēvēlgapye talge mey a neketket yeh. Net et gilgeg te nēm̄ nan, tō nēm̄ nan et ēm̄ telemyam te. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kraēs mahayveg hay Mahē Yon̄ a Noyon̄ vag tiwag woy ēwē. Tō kē et qele te ige pris lililwo telemyam gōh, a kēy mahayveg hay Mahē Yon̄ mi naday ne nanigot wa naday ne inti bōlōk. Tateh. Ba Kraēs mahayveg hay Mahē Yon̄ alge mi naday nonon mahgen. Tō kē matamgoy gēn mi naday nonon vag tiwag woy ēwē so gēn totog wawah lap tasga.<verse eid="HEB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Naday non nanigot itōk so ak wenwen nataqn̄ige, ba naday non Kraēs neketket yeh. Et tow van. Mahē ige pris tam̄ag olol mi nanigot wa nōbōlōk tam̄an wa nōbōlōk lōqōvēn en, kēy lep naday siso nōwōwō nan tō tetn̄eg van hiy ige sil. Tō naday si nōwōwō nan tak wenwen nataqn̄ige lengon Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />!Ba naday non Kraēs en, naman nan nitiy ketket yeh! Veg Kraēs newenwen, tō kē mukēg nēh nonon so niolol aē van hiy Ḡod heylō Nuvu mey a notogtog lap vaga. Tō naday nonon haytēyēh so niak wenwen nēdēmdēm nongēn. Ak tō so gēn ukēg veteg namgumgu tam̄ag a yeghuquy ēwē, tō van me noyowyowveg non Ḡod. Namgumgu tam̄ag en, tateh ēh aē, ba Ḡod en, kē nēh.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naday molon̄ tō maktig navatvat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kraēs gōh, ikē nitig lēvētnangēn bakaktig nakavanan gayaq non Ḡod. Veg bamatmat nonon, kē matamgoy negengenyeg non ige sil, veg kēy et dēmap te nakavanan tam̄ag. Kraēs mak tō so ige et mey a Ḡod mōlōl kēy me en, kēy telep nēh lap mey a Ḡod mavatvat van hiy kēy.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16-17" />Nakavanan non Ḡod qeleso nēvēyvēyne. Mahē net vitwag so nimat en, kē nivēyvēyne. Ba so kē wo et mat te, tō nēvēyvēyne nen yeghuquy ēwē. Bastō nēvēyvēyne nan taktig ēwē vēh a so gēn ēglal so net nan mamat.<verse eid="HEB 9:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Veg bege gōh en, nakavanan tam̄ag maktig ēwē veg naday molon̄. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Mahē Mosis mavasemlō qēt naln̄e vayēg del Bele non Ḡod hiy ige sil en, kē niswuy naday apwoy. Kē meswuy qelegēn. Kē melep naday ne bōlōk su tiwag mi naday ne nani, tō nilēy mi nēbē. Tō nilep nayo tētēnge vitwag, ōl so “nihiysop,” wa nili sipsip a nalawlaw, tō niqēl hōw laday, tō nitetn̄eg van lōbōk ne Le non Ḡod, wa apwon ige sil. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Tō kē mavap so, “Igōhkē naday so niak nakavanan non Ḡod gōh nitig maymay. Tō Ḡod mal ōl gontegoy so kimi so dēmap.”<verse eid="HEB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Tō qelese anen, Mosis metetn̄eg naday apwo ēm̄ tēvēlgapye nen wa apwo haphap del a kēy mogmogo aē en. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Tō Nele non Mosis mavap so sisqet vel haphap del en, ige pris so ak wenwen mi naday. Ba sowo tateh day tō so nilon̄ en, tateh dēmveteg bug geh.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kraēs melep van nēh nonon, tō naday nonon molon̄ so nitamgoy nubug non nisil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Vel haphap lelo ēm̄ tēvēlgapye non ige Juw en, ikē nototgal ne haphap hag lōtōk en. Tō ige pris tam̄ag mak wenwen nahaphap nan lengon Ḡod mi nolol gōh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">For lectionary: Kēy molol mi nōbōlōk, nani, wa nisipsip, tō kēy tetn̄eg geh naday nan apwo haphap del ne Ēm̄ Yon̄.</char></note> Ba nitiy haphap a hag lōtōk en, kēy neketket yeh den nahaphap telemyam gōh a nototgal ēwē. So ak wenwen nahaphap talge en, itōk so olol mi nage mey a neketket yeh.<verse eid="HEB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Veg Kraēs et hayveg te hay Mahē Yon̄ a ige et mētēy kal tō mi namney. Tateh. Meynen namalēn ēwē. Ba kē mal van litiy mahē yon̄ hag alge en, tō so kē nitig leh gēn lengon Ḡod, tō kōyō hohole nogoyō.<verse eid="HEB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Tō Kraēs et olol te vag m̄adeg, tateh, ba vag tiwag ēwē. Kē et qele te ige pris lililwo telemyam agōh, veg kēy hayveg hay Mahē Yon̄ velvel ēte bolol, tō kēy et olol te mi naday nonoy. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Ba Kraēs so tak tō qelenen, togtō kē toyon̄ memeh vag m̄adeg. Ba naqtēqtēg ne mayam, tō mēdēn̄ me qiyig gōh, et qele te nen. Togtōkē, yipteg nōlsi mayam, Kraēs mavan me vag tiwag woy ēwē tō molol mi nēh nonon so nitamgoy nubug.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Namtehal vitwag ēwē: net tamat vag tiwag woy, tō me atgiy, Ḡod tēvēvēg kē. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Tō qelese nen, Kraēs mukēg nēh nonon vag tiwag woy so nitamgoy nubug non ige m̄adeg. Tō kē tavan lok me vagyō negi, et bubug site, ba so nivaēh ige a nenyē kē.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Nani wa nisipsip tit tamgoy vēhte nubug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Nahaphap lelo Le non Mosis en, kē nēnēnē haphap mey nēwē aso nivan me. Kē et tiy haphap te, kē qeleso nototgal ēwē. Veg bege gōh, nolol a kēy olol vaga vel ēte en, nolol nan tit ak yon̄ qēt vēhte ige mey a so van sisqet Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Nolol nan so tahaytēyēh tō en, togtō kēy tukēg veteg nolol, veg kēy mal wenwen nowmat, wa tō kēy tit mamayge vēhte bubug. Ba tateh. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Tō nolol gōh niak dēmsas kēy bubug nonoy vel ēte. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Veg naday ne bōlōk tam̄an wa nani tit lepyak vēhte nubug.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Veg bege gōh, mahē Kraēs mavan me lemyam gōh en, kē mavap van hiy Ḡod so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">Nolol wa nalen̄a en, nēk et buste,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">ba nēk mētēymat ēwē nataqn̄ik.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Tō nēk et malaklak te veg bolol tegtegha se.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bolol tegtegha se </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nohohole bolol gōh vōyō. Leviticus 1, Leviticus 6:8-13. Nolol vitwag mey a nep nigen sabun qēt. Nolol vōyō negi mey a kēy olol bubug. Leviticus 4:1-5:13, 6:24-30.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Tō no mavap so, “!Ḡod, no agōh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">qele mayap gatay tō no Layapyap Yon̄!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Nok so aktig namyōs nōnōm.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 40:6-8</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Kē mavap am̄ag so, “Nolol, nalen̄a, wa nolol tegtegha se, nēk et buste, tō nēk et malaklak te aē.” (Ba Nele mavayēg so kēy tagaleg.) <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Tō me atgiy en, kē mavap so, “Ḡod, no agōh, nok so aktig namyōs nōnōm.” Kē melepyak nēdēmdēm tam̄ag tō so niaktig nēdēmdēm vōyō negi. Namanig nan, Ḡod nemyōs so namgumgu non Kraēs teleh goy nolol ne Le. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Veg Ḡod nemyōs so gēn so yon̄. Tō Tigsas Kraēs mal ak yon̄ gēn mahē kē molol mi nataqn̄ēn vag tiwag woy veg ige del.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nolol non Kraēs nesey so nitamgoy nowmat nubug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Vel qōn̄ del en, ige pris tam̄ag tig lēm̄ tēvēlgapye so ak tasga namgumgu namuy a kēy olol bubug, ba nolol nan tit lepyak vēhte nubug non ige et. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ba Kraēs en, ikē nipris liwo a netegha. Kē matamgoy nubug vag tiwag woy mi nolol vitwag mey a namaymay lap. Tō me atgiy en, kē mahaghiy how lemtō non Ḡod. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Tō kē ninyē gaydēn̄ a Ḡod nim̄ōk tēqēl ige tavale nonon antan, tō kē tavayvay vēh how apwoy. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Veg bolol vitwag nen, Tigsas mak yon̄ lap qēt ige a Ḡod nemyōs so kēy yon̄.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Tō Nuvu Yon̄ nivasemlō galsi me hiy gēn. Am̄ag kē mavap so,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />Welan mavap so, “Igōhkē nakavanan a nok so lep van hiy ige Juw.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">Mahē vanvan tō en,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">a no tōm̄ōk Nele mino lelo taqay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">wa no tayap vasem van lēdēmdēm nonoy.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jeremiah 31:33</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Tō me atgiy en, mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Tō no tit dēmsas lok vēhte nubug wa nehelhel le nonoy.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jeremiah 31:34</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Mahē Ḡod nidēmveteg nubug qelegōh en, tateh olol ne bug se.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mal wak namtehal so gēn van sisqet hiy Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Sōwlē, yathithik wa yatētētek, itōk so gēn van me lengon Ḡod ba nitog mētēgteg. Veg naday non Tigsas mak tō gēn tahayveg vēh van Mahē Yon̄. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Veg Tigsas mukēg van nataqn̄ēn so niwak namtehal gayaq heylō namalmal a nadam goy Mahē Yon̄ nan. Wa veg kē nēh, tō namtehal nongēn nataywah. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Kē nitiy pris liwo nongēn a kē nam̄agoy ige sil lēm̄ non Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Sōwlē, itōk so gēn van sisqet me hiy Ḡod, mi nitiy dēmdēm vitwag wa nēdēmtig mey a namaymay. Ukēg Kraēs so niak wenwen gēn alon wa aslil. Kraēs mal tetn̄eg naday nonon lelo taqangēn so lepyak namayge ne bug nongēn. Wa kē mal oh nataqn̄ēngēn mi nēbē mey nemyeyen. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tig maymay lēdēmdēm a gēn vavasemlō bēdēmdēyē, wa nitog dēmdēm vōvōyō, veg Ḡod mavatvat, tō kē taktig.<verse eid="HEB 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Itōk so gēn dēmsas tow so gēn tavasusup gēn qeleave batamtam wa bemgumgu mey nēwē. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Gēn nitog ukukēg veteg nahayhay tiwag, qele nēmētwun yatkel et, ba hole vey biyin̄ gēn, tō vaqlēh mi nohohole vasusup vaga, veg gēn et van so nōqōn̄ non Kraēs ninognog geh me.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēvēvēg non ige mey a kēy nepsipteg Ēntēn Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />So gēn wo nēglal galsi nēhēyhēywē, ba gēn gengenyeg tasga tatag van lemyōs nongēn en, tō tateh olol bubug se. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Ba gēn so dēm mētēgteg goy ēwē nēvēvēg. Nēvēvēg nan ikē nep a nesew vevey tegen qelen̄ ige tavale non Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Dēm tow van. So net wo mehelhel Nele non Mosis en, kēy tēvēvēg kē aē so kē tamat. Net vōyō si vētēl wo metgeh kē en, tō tateh magaysēn geh. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />?Ba kimi dēmdēm qeleave veg ige a kēy vayvay apwon Ēntēn Ḡod, wa mak hethet naday ne kavanan mey a mak yon̄ tō kēy, wa mohole visipteg Nuvu mey a nasgōp aē mi kē? Kēy tavan lēvēvēg mey a tiy het yeh. <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Veg gēn nēglal so Ḡod mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">No tayam lok, tō ino mahgēk tavalehyam goy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 32:35</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:30">Wa tō,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">Welan Ḡod tēvēvēg ige sil nonon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 32:36, Sam 135:14</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />!Nitiy Ḡod a nēh en, mahē kē nitēy maymay net so nivēvēg kē en, ikē nage mētēgteg!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tig netnet qele am̄ag so lep nayseyse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Dēmsas tow me am̄ag, mahē a namyeyen mavan totogyeg tō me hiy kimi en. Kimi mitig maymay tō boyon̄yon̄ninhet goy nememeh liwo. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Yatkel mahē ige sil ak mamayge kimi wa ak tōqtōqyeg kimi, wa yatkel mahē kimi tig tiwag lapgetō so biyin̄ ige mey a kēy akak qelenen hiy kēy. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Wa kimi memgaysēn tō ige a notog lēm̄ yētyēt. Tō kimi memlaklak mahē a kēy mak qēqēsyeg namlami, veg kimi nēglal vatag so namlami aē hag lōtōk mey a nitiy wē yeh a totog lap vaga.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Sōwlē, nitog so suwyeg yak nēdēmtig nonmi veg nayseyse liwo aē. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Atmi tig netnet ba ak namyōs non Ḡod, tō so kimi telep vēh nayseyse aē, qele kē mavatvat tō aē. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">Mahē mal nognog a mal nognog me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">tō net a nivanvan me en, kē tavan me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">Ba tateh hap nitigoy kē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 26:20</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Ba net tenenen mino tēh heylō nēdēmtig maymay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">Ba nēdēmdēm nonon wo mem̄geygey en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">tō nalo teqek tit malaklak vēhte veg kē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Habakkuk 2:3-4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ba gēn et ige m̄egeygey te mey a tavan lep, ba igēn ige dēmtig mey a tētēy nēh lap.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">?Nahap Nēdēmtig?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Nēdēmtig en, kē nēdēmdēm maymay bēdēmdēyē navatvat non Ḡod. Tō nēdēmtig niak vēglal gēn so nahap a gēn et etgeh te en, kē hēyhēywē. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Veg bēdēmtig nonoy en, Ḡod met lolwē ige lililwo tam̄ag. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Heylō nēdēmtig nongēn en, gēn ēglal galsi so Ḡod mitin̄ namyam mi nohohole nonon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 1</char></note> Ak tō so nahaphap a gēn tetsas vēh lemyam gōh en, Ḡod mitin̄yak den nahap mey a gēn tit etsas vēhte.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Abel en, kē melep van nolol a nitiy wē yeh den Ken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 4:3-5</char></note> Tō Ḡod mavap so nolol nonon itōk, tō met lolwē kē so kē netnenen. Abel mal mat, ba heylō lēdēmtig nonon, kē hole lapgetō. Veg togtōkē nēmētwun nivatvatne gēn bēdēmtig.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Enok en, Ḡod melepyak kē den namyam gōh, a kē et van heylō te namatmat.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 5:21-24</char></note> Net et etsas te natayben veg Ḡod melep yak kē qeleanen. Am̄ag den Ḡod nilepyak kē en, Ḡod met lolwē kē veg kē mak malaklak Ḡod. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Asaw den nēdēmtig en, net tit ak malaklak vēhte Ḡod. Net mey nēdēmtig so Ḡod agōh, wa nēdēmtig so Ḡod telep van nayseyse en, net nan nosoksok Ḡod. Ba net mey a et dēmtig te qeleanen, kē et soksok te Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Noah en, kē mavaēh ige nonon den nililip.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 6-8</char></note> Veg Noah mēdēmtig Ḡod mahē a Ḡod mohole vētday van hiy kē so nililip tavan me. Tō Noah et et qete nililip nan, ba kē mēdēmap Ḡod mi namtēgteg, tō mowos nabaklap liwo. Heylō nēdēmtig non Noah en nēvēvēg liwo maqal ige sil telemyam. Tō Ḡod mavap so Noah netnenen veg bēdēmtig nonon.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Abraham en, kē mēdēmap nōlōl non Ḡod, tō kē mavan yak den mahē nonon, tō nivan hiy mahē tegha a kē et ēglal te.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 12:1-4</char></note> Tō Ḡod mavatvat so lep nēvētan nan van hiy kē.<verse eid="HEB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Tō heylō nēdēmtig nonon en, kē motog lepnō a Ḡod mavatvat van hiy kē, ba kē nahalvan ēwē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 12:4-7</char></note> Kē motog lēm̄ tēvēlgapye, wa tō ēntēn Isak kōyō bōbō Jakop en, kōyō motog se qeleanen. Tō nēvēyvēyne ne vatvat nan nivan tabay van hiy kōyō. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Abraham mak qelegōh veg kē dēyē lapgetō nitiy vōnō a nēhyēn aē, a Ḡod mahgen mētēymat wa mowos.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mahē gōh lagatgat Tikrik et m̄ōleg te so kē hohole gatay Abraham siso Sera. Sowo Sera en, neves gōh so, “Heylō nēdēmtig, Sera mavan me tita.”</char>
    </note>Heylō nēdēmtig non Abraham en, kē mavan me imam. Abraham mal tamayge, wa ēgnōn a Sera, kē et leplepm̄ey te. Ba kē nēdēmtig so Ḡod taktig qēt navatvat nonon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 15:1-6</char></note> Tō Ḡod mak so kōyō tavawot vēh nēnētm̄ey.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 21:1-2</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ak tō so niginwotwot m̄adeg mavantabay me den net vitwag, net mey a et leplepm̄ey te. Ba heylō ēwē navatvat en, mak tō kēy nēvēwti qele nivit hag lemyayawoy, wa qele nēvētan yow ale en, a tit vatah qēt vēhte.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Ige lililwo gōh mamat tēy nēdēmtig nonoy, ba kēy et tēy qal te hap qete a Ḡod mavatvat tō van hiy kēy aē. Ba kēy netsas nahaphap yeh tewiwi lapgetō, tō kēy malaklak aē. Tō kēy mavasemlō so kēy togtō lemyam gōh qeleso nahalvan ēwē, kēy et tēgvōnō telemyam gōh te.<verse eid="HEB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Ige mey a hohole qelegōh en, kēy vasemlō so kēy soksok nitiy vōnō nonoy. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ba sowo kēy dēmdēm lok napnō nonoy tam̄ag lemyam gōh en, togtō kēy tōm̄ōl lok, ba kēy et ak te. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ige gōh nemyōs napnō tegha nonoy mey a nitiy wē yeh, a hag lōtōk en. Veg bege gōh en, mahē kēy ōl Ḡod so ikē Ḡod nonoy en, Ḡod et mamayge te aē. Veg Ḡod mal tēymat napnō liwo nonoy.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17-18" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Abraham, mahē Ḡod mehlet etgal kē en, Abraham mukēg Isak so niolol aē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 22:1-19</char></note> Isak en, kē vitwag woy a ēntēn Abraham, tō Ḡod mavatvat gatay kē so, “Heylō Isak en, ige ginwotwot nōnōm telep nahami.” Abraham melep navatvat nan, ba kē mētēymat so niwuh mat kē tō niolol aē van hiy Ḡod. <verse eid="HEB 11:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Veg Abraham mēdēmdēm so Ḡod tak ēh lokse vēh net den namatmat. Tō hēyhēywē, kē melep lokse me Isak, qeleaso kē mēh lok den namatmat.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Isak en, kē mavawē Jakop kōyō Esau tō so nahaphap mey nēwē tavan vēh me hiy kōyō.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 27</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Jakop, mahē a sisqet so kē nimat en, kē mitig taqlun̄ mi nēqētōwtōw nonon so niōl liwo Ḡod, tō kē nivawē yoge yantēntēn Jōsēp.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 48:8-20</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Jōsēp, mahē sisqet so kē nimat en, kē mavap so Ḡod telep yak ige Tisrael den Itsip.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 50:24-25</char></note> Tō kē mēvēyvēyne so kēy tivig nihiy nonon n̄a lepnō non ige Tisrael.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Heylō nēdēmtig, mahē a Moses mowot me en, imam wa tita nonon mōlōn̄veg kē bōwōl vētēl.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 2:1-10</char></note> Veg nēqēt mayanag Fero mavayēg so wuh nēnētm̄ey tam̄an del non ige Tisrael. Kōyō mōlōn̄veg kē veg kōyō met van so nēnētm̄ey nan itōktōk lēs. Tō kōyō et mētēgteg te so tigoy nele non nēqēt mayanag.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Namalmal non Fero matayak tō Moses, ba heylō nēdēmtig, mahē Moses milwo hag en, kē et buste so kēy ōl kē ēntēn namalmal nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 2:10-11</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Veg kē et buste so nidam namtehal negengenyeg a namlaklak nan namaltē ēwē. Ba kē memyōs so niqultiwag mi ige non Ḡod so kē niyon̄memeh tiwag mi kēy. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Mahē ige Titsip mohole het van hiy kē veg Kraēs en, Mosis et dēmdēm te van aē. Mosis mēdēm so meygōh itōk veteg nam̄e haphap del non Itsip, veg Mosis dēmdēm ēwē beyseyse a Ḡod so lep van hiy kē.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Heylō nēdēmtig en, Moses mavan yak den Itsip. Mahē nēqēt mayanag mololgagay kē en, Moses et mētēgteg te ba mavan tasga qeleso kē met ēwē van hiy Ḡod mey a net et etgeh te.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 14:10-14</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Moses, tatag van naln̄e vayēg non Ḡod en, Moses magaleg Negengen Yowlege wa metetetn̄eg naday van lemte ēm̄ nonoy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 12:1-30</char></note> Kē mak qelegōh tō so nin̄sel a Ḡod mēvētleg so wuh ige matgayaq non ige Titsip en, kē tit tan̄qal vēhte ige Tisrael.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Heylō nēdēmtig en, ige Tisrael mavan woy Nanaw Lawlaw qele vanvan wotanmas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 14:15-31</char></note> Ba mahē ige Titsip mehlet temuy en, kēy moyoy wa mamatmat qēt.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Heylō nēdēmtig en, ige Tisrael mavan walēg napnō Jeriko bōqōn̄ liviyō.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Joshua 6:1-21</char></note> Tō me atgiy en, negeay vet walēg Jeriko matatamyuy qēt.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Heylō nēdēmtig non Rahab a nalqōvēn telemtehal en, kē et mat te tiwag mi ige helhel le Tejeriko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Joshua 6:22-25</char></note> Kē et mat te veg kē melep vasgēt galsi yoge et Tisrael mey a mavan bat tō so et wiwiyeg nalo vōnō.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Joshua 2:1-21</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />?Nok so vap se qeleave? No mal hole hoyo meh, tō no tit hole gatay se vēhte Gideon, Barak, Samson, Septa, Devēt wa Samuel tiwag mi ige lēgēlgēg. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Heylō nēdēmtig en, ige gōh mak woqse haphap. Kēy malalaket goy ige tavale bepgapgal. Kēy van tēy nele wa vēvēg tenenen. Kēy mētēy nahaphap a Ḡod mavatvat tō aē. Kēy mitigoy nalayon so tit kuy vēhte kēy. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Kēy mavan heylō nep ba kēy et metewot te. Kēy meplaplag qelen̄ den nan̄ye gasel bepgal. Ige sosol mavan me mamaymay. Kēy mavan me mamaymay bepgapgal. Kēy mōvōy ige vēwti halvan bepgapgal. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Ige lōqōvēn melep lok me yantēntēy den namatmat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Mahē ige helhel nele makak tēqtēqyeg kēy en, kēy et buste so van taywah. Ba kēy memyōs so mat mi noyon̄ memeh, tō so tēy nēh lap aē. Veg nēh lap itōk veteg nēh telemyam agōh. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Yatkel et en, kēy moboyboyheg kēy wa tō melm̄elm̄eh kēy. Kēy mēlēg yatkel et mi nējēn wa mōm̄ōk kēy lēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Kēy miyim matmat kēy mi nevet. Kēy mosom̄ēt nataqn̄ey aē vōyō tō kēy mamatmat. Kēy tot mat kēy mi nagasel bepgal. Yatkelgi nem̄say, tateh noy leleh, tō kēy malmal ēwē mi nipni sipsip ba nipni nani. Kēy yon̄ memeh, wa ige a helhel nele mak nehet hiy kēy. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Kēy nam̄e et, tō namyam gōh et sey te so kēy so tog aē. Ba kēy motog soloteg lepnō vadalm̄eg wa luwutwut wa leqyo vet wa lelo lē.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Ige del gōh en, Ḡod met lolwē kēy bēdēmtig nonoy, ba kēy et tēy qal te nahap a Ḡod mavatvat van hiy kē. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Veg Ḡod mētēytēymat nahaphap mey nēwē yeh veg gēn, tō asaw den gēn en, kēy tit tēy qēt vēhte navawē. Namanig nan so Ḡod tuqultiwag gēn tiwag mi kēy, tō kē telep nayseyse hiy gēn del vag tiwag ēwē.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ak qele ige tam̄ag mey a mēdēmtig maymay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Woqse et a kēy mavasemlō nēmētvuge bēdēmtig. Ikē qeleso gēn so gētyak valeh, wa kēy nahag walēg tō gayka mi namlaklak van hiy gēn. Sowle, itōk so gēn ukēg veteg nētētēy dēw del, wa nubug mey a gēn tavan gon towoyig vēh aē. Tō gēn sikyak valeh hiy mahē mey a Ḡod mal togyak vatag veg gēn, wa nitog n̄ayn̄ay den. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Et ēwē van hiy Tigsas. Kē nōtōti dēmtig wa nōlsi dēmtig. Veg kē met ēwē nayseyse bemlaklak en, tō kē et dēmsas te namamayge. Ba kē mavan heylō noyon̄memeh apwo wolwol. Tō togtōkē, kē nahag lemtō a letno haghag non Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Atmi dēmsas tow Tigsas, a qeleave tō ige gengenyeg metvale mi kē ba kē mitig maymay, tō so kimi tit n̄ayn̄ay vēhte tō tiple sisgoy den nēdēmtig. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Kimi se metvale mi negengenyeg, ba kimi et tig maymay te gaydēn̄ a naday nonmi molon̄ veg. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Tō kimi wun mololqōn̄ nohohole bevey biyin̄ mey a Ḡod mōlōl tō kimi ige yantēntēn so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Intik, nēk nitog dēmdēm su aē mahē a Ḡod niak maymay hiy nēk so nivatne nēk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">Mahē kē nihole maymay hiy nēk en, nitog so nēdēmdēm nōnōm nisisgoy aē.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Veg Ḡod gōh, kē tavatne galsi ige a kē natam kēy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">wa kē nivēvēg ige a kē vap so ikēy ige yantēntēn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Proverbs 3:11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḡod nivatne nēk qele imam vitwag nivatne ēntēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Atmi tēygoy nememeh del a niqalqal kimi en, veg nememeh qeleso navatvatne a mavan me den Namam. Veg Ḡod niak hiy kimi qeleso ige yantēntēn. ?Wō ige imam nakak hiy ēntēn qelenen? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ḡod nivatne yantēntēn del. So Ḡod wo et vatne te kimi en, tō nēdēmdēm nan so kimi et tiy yantēntēn te, ba kimi nēnētm̄ey talamaltow ēwē.<verse eid="HEB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Wa tō, gēn nēglal so imam nongēn me lemyam kē, kēy mavatne gēn, tō gēn dēmap kēy aē. ?Tō qeleave veg imam nongēn hag lōtōk en? Itōk so gēn dēmap yeh kē, ak tō gēn tētēy vēh nēh lap aē. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ige imam nongēn me lemyam gōh en, kēy mavatne gēn, ba namaltē ēwē, ba kēy dēm van a so itōk mi kēy qeleanen. Ba Ḡod nivatne gēn veg kē nemyōs so nimyin̄ gēn, tō so gēn toyon̄ vēh qele ikē veg kē noyon̄.<verse eid="HEB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mahē nage vitwag niqal net vitwag so nivatne kē en, kē tit malaklak vēhte ba kē nilolwon aē. Ba so kē wo mōm̄ōleg galsi bavatvatne nan en, tō kē telep nayseyse aē bēmētwuge tenenen, tō kē totog a natm̄at aē mi kē.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tēy maymay vēlēs navatvatne mey nēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Sōwlē, atmi suwyeg kēlkēl namnemi mey et hon̄hon̄yeg te tō en, wa nayn̄omi mey a meyeyey tō en. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Ak tenenen namtehal tō so nayn̄omi mey a nememeh aē en, tit tēvēy lok vēhte, ba niwē lokse. Namanig nan so ak maymay lokse nēdēmtig nonmi.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Atmi helhel etgal so tog letm̄at tiwag mi ige sil del, wa atmi tog tēy nēh mey a noyon̄. Veg ige yon̄ vēlēs a tet Welan. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Tō etgoy galsi so tateh et nitigkēlē den nasgōp non Ḡod. Tō nitog ukukēg so net vitwag nivan me navatgo a nehet. Veg navatgo het qeleso nagapyuy. Kē nōqōvē, tō kē tak sapsapwōy vēh ige m̄adeg. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Etgoy so tateh et nilegleg soloteg. Wa etgoy so tateh et tit dēmap vēhte Ḡod, qeleso Esau.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 12:16">Dēm lok Esau. Imam nonon mēvēyvēyne so Esau telep navawē liwo, ba kē mukēg veteg navatvat nan. Esau men̄yeg navatvat nan veg begengen ēwē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 25:29-34</char></note> Ba negengen nan, kē megen qēt vag tiwag woy. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Tō me atgiy en, kimi nēglal vatag. Mahē Esau nemyōs so nilep navawē nan den imam nonon en, imam nonon et mōyōs goy te.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 27:30-40</char></note> Tō Esau mosoksok lēlēge namtehal a so nileh nēdēmdēm non imam nonon, tō kē niten̄ aē.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Am̄ag ige Tisrael tit van sisqet vēhte hiy Ḡod veg kē noyon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Mahē kimi van sisqet Ḡod en, et qele te mahē a ige Tisrael mavan sisqet tō Ḡod. Am̄ag kēy mavan luwutwut Sinai, mey a kēy teteyqal vēh. Tō Ḡod mēhēw tēqēl me luwutwut nan. Tō nep nalawlaw aē, wa mahē nōqōn̄ wa nemlēglēg sil, wa nelen̄ maymay aē.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 19:9-25, Exodus 20:18-2, Deuteronomy 5:22-27</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Naln̄e tō nipip liwo aē, tō ige Tisrael yon̄teg a Ḡod niōlōl kēy. Kēy moyon̄teg nohohole nonon en, tō kēy mēvēhge maymay so kē nitog hohole lokse me hiy kēy. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Veg kēy tit tig maymay vēhte leln̄e vayēg mey a Ḡod mōlgontegoy so, “Kimi nitog vanvan me luwutwut agōh. Sowo net siso nahap qiyig tuytuy wo mavan dēn̄ van luwutwut gōh en, atmi yim mat kē.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Mosis met nage gōh en, tō kē memtēgteg temun se, tō kē mavap wo, “No memtēgteg temuk tō nihyik meyeyey aē.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gēn tavan sisqet vēh hiy Ḡod lemyeyen talge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ba kimi qiyig gōh netegha. Mahē kimi van sisqet Ḡod en, qeleso kē nilep kal kimi lemyeyen talge. Tō kimi mavan me luwutwut Saeon, igōhkē Jerusalem hag lōtōk en, a nalqelqevōnō non Ḡod a kē nēh tasga. Hag tō alon en ige in̄sel tey vag tey laklak mi namlaklak. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Tō hag tō alon en, nēvēwti nētnētm̄ey mey a kēy nam̄agoy. Ḡod mal qisen̄ vatag nahay lōbōk nonon. Tō hag tō alon en, Ḡod a tēvēvēg nisil del. Tō igōh kē natalan ige tenenen a Ḡod mak tō kēy nam̄e et yeh. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Tō igōh kē Tigsas a ikē nitiy et bakaktig nakavanan gayaq non Ḡod. Tō igōh kē naday non Tigsas a kē metetn̄eg apwon gēn so niak so gēn wenwen. Naday nan nitiy wē yeh den naday non Abel, veg naday non Abel mavasemlō so Ḡod tēvēvēg vēh nubug nagan net. Kimi mal van sisqet me hiy Ḡod ēgēn, tō nahaphap del gōh hiy kimi.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />!Etgoy galsi! Nitog yon̄yon̄vavaleh nohohole non Ḡod. Veg mahē kē mohole vētday ige Tisrael lemyam goh, kēy moyon̄vavaleh. Kēy et yow veteg te den nēvēvēg. Ba togtō qiyig gōhkē en, kē nahag letno liwo talge nonon so nihole vētday gēn. ?So gēn wo yon̄vavaleh kē, tō gēn so yow veteg den nēvēvēg qeleave? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Me am̄ag en, naln̄an Ḡod mak namyam kē miyiyeg qēt. Ba togtōkē kē mavatvat so, “No tiyiyeg namyam vag tiwag se. Ba et namyam vēlēs te, ba nōtōq se.”<verse eid="HEB 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Nohohole a Ḡod mavap en so, “Vag tiwag se,” nēdēmdēm nan so vel haphap mey a tiyiyeg vēh en, kēy tisisgoy qēt, tō Ḡod telep yakyak kēy. Ḡod telepyak natawye haphap del a kē mitin̄ tō lemyam agōh. Ba nahaphap talge non Ḡod ēwē a tit yiyeg vēhte en, kēy tahag lap.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Tō Ḡod telep me hiy gēn napnō vitwag mey a kē mahgen temyanag goy. !Napnō nan tit mumuyeg vēhte! Bastō itōk so gēn vēwē Ḡod aē, tō mogmogo goy kē mi nēdēmap wa namtēgteg lemtehal mey a kē temlaklak aē. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Veg hēywē, Ḡod nongēn qeleso nep mey a tegen qēt nowmat nahaphap a kē so nivēvēg.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 4:24</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Nēmētwōn ige non Kraēs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Atmi tog vēy tamtam kimi qeleso ige yathithimi wa ige yatētētami. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Kimi so tēymat vaga beleplep vasgēt ige halvan me lēm̄ nonmi. Veg me am̄ag yatkel et melep vasgēt tō ige in̄sel, a kēy et ēglal hōn te veg kēy. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Atmi dēmsas ige non Ḡod mey a ige sil ak tōqtōqyeg kēy, veg kimi tiple yon̄ memeh lataqn̄imi qele ikēy. Tō atmi dēmsas ige a kēy notog lēm̄ yētyēt, qeleso kimi notog tiwag mi kēy. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Atmi del dēmap namtehal ne legleg, tō etgoy galsi so kimi wenwen den legleg soloteg. Veg Ḡod tēvēvēg net mey a nilegleg soloteg siso nimtiy tiwag mi ēgnōn net tegha. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nitog tamtam meh nēsēm lēh nonmi, ba tog malaklak mi natkel hap nonmi anen. Veg Ḡod mal vap vatag so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">No tit ukēg veteg vēhte nēk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">wa n̄ēh en, no tit dēmveteg vēhte nēk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Joshua 1:5</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Nohohole nan mak tō gēn titig maymay vēh so vap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Welan Ḡod nemyin̄ tasga no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">tō no tit mētēgteg vēhte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">nahap te a nisil takak hiy no en.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 118:6</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matēg ēwē van hiy Tigsas, ba nitog matēg van Lele non ige Juw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Atmi dēm m̄ōl lok hiy ige mey mal mat vatag, ige mey a mitig helem̄ag tō kimi, wa mavatne kimi bohohole non Ḡod. Dēm lōlhiy tow qeleave nēmētwuy, tō dam tatag kēy lemtehal ne dēmtig nonoy. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Tigsas Kraēs ikē haytēyēh qele anoy, qiyig, talōw, wa tō totog lap qeleanen.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Etgoy, veg ige vatvatgo tegtegha tiple ak so kimi kalen̄. Navatvatne nonoy netegha den noyoy ēwē. Nok hole gatay nele begengen non ige Juw, a nahap tē a kēy gengen siso et gengen te. Mahē kēy megen negengen nan en, tateh wē aē mi kēy. Ba nahap mey itōk so ak maymay kimi lelo taqami en, ikē nasgōp non Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Nasgōp nan mavan heylō me nolol non Tigsas, a kē mamat so nitamgoy nubug. Ba ige pris lelo ēm̄ halgoy tēvēlgapye en, kēy et su sey hōn te so van tiwag me mi gēn lolta nongēn.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Tigsas meleh nolol bubug non ige pris tam̄ag. Am̄ag, vel ēte Nipris Liwo molol mi nisipsip bubug en, tō kē melep bat naday hay lelo Mahē Yon̄. Ba nataqn̄ēy sipsip en, kē nivan tēylō aslil den napnō, tō nep nigen qelen̄.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Leviticus 16:27</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Tō qelese anen Tigsas moyon̄ memeh aslil lemtegeay ne vōnō tō so niak yon̄ ige sil mi naday nonon.<verse eid="HEB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Sōwlē, itōk so gēn kalō yak den napnō, tō van hiy Tigsas. Nitog dēmdēm van aē sowo ige sil wo mohole hethet hiy gēn qele a kēy mohole hethet tō hiy kē en. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Veg lemyam gōh en, tateh vōnō nongēn a totog lap. Ba gēn soksok nitiy vōnō mey a vanvan lapgetō me.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vēwē wa ōliwo Ḡod heylō namgumgu mey nēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Sōwlē, itōk so vaga gēn lep van nitiy olol so vēwē Ḡod heylō Tigsas. Nolol nan so gēn ōlwē kē. Net mey a nivasemlō Tigsas mi naplan en, kē nōlwē Ḡod vaga. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Wa nitog lololqōn̄ so ak nahaphap mey nēwē hiy ige et, wa atmi vēyvēy biyin̄ kimi mi nahaphap nonmi, veg namgumgu qelenen en, ikē nolol mey a niak malaklak Ḡod.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Atmi dēmap ige lililwo goy kimi, wa yon̄teg galsi nohohole nonoy. Veg namgumgu namuy so etgoy kimi lemtehal bēdēmtig, tō Ḡod tēvēhge kēy aē. Yon̄teg kēy tō so kēy mugumgu mi namlaklak, ba et momoy yoyon̄ te. So kimi wo ak memeh kēy en, tō tateh wē aē mi kimi.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Yēhē, atmi tatay biyin̄ kemem. Veg kemem et yon̄teg te so nēdēmdēm nonmem nivēvēg kemem, ba kemem nemyōs so namtevumem nēwē vēlēs vaga. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Tō no nemyōs yeh so kimi vēhge van hiy Ḡod so kē nivētleg ēgē lok no me hiy kimi.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babah ne tatay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nok tatay so Ḡod tavahiy maymay kimi. Ḡod betm̄at en, kē melep kal Welan nongēn Tigsas den namatmat. Tigsas en, ikē Net Liwo betet goy sipsip. Tō naday nonon molon̄ tō so niaktig nakavanan gayaq. Tō nakavanan nan taktig lap. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Tō kemem vēhge Ḡod so vahiy maymay kimi mi nahaphap ēwē del tō so kimi tak vēh nahap a kē nemyōs. Tō kemem tatay so kē tak nahap a kē temlaklak aē lēh nongēn. Kemem tatay so Ḡod tak vēh qelegōh heylō Tigsas Kraēs. !Lep nēlēn̄as van hiy Tigsas vaga! Qeleanen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babah ne hohole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek. No mayap me neletes malte gōh so hole biyin̄ kimi. No nemyōs so kimi yon̄teg galgalsi nahap a no mayap vasem me hiy kimi aē.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Togtōkē ēthēn gēn a Timoti, kē mal kalō den nēm̄ yētyēt. Ba kē wo mavan ēgē me gōh en, tō kamyō qoyo van me vatēp kimi.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />No nemyōs so kimi vasemlō lemtap nēwē mino van hiy ige lililwo nonmi tiwag mi ige et del non Kraēs. Wa ige et n̄a Itali, kēy se vap lemtap nēwē van hiy kimi.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Nasgōp non Ḡod nitog mi kimi del.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>